{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e243d6006945d2801f54","chatId":"610546ca9e884e7c86d55269e7db8ef9","sessionId":null,"userId":58723,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":871,"promptTokens":1551,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:27"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0031726824183452365,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e243d6006945d2801f53","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368067236,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e243d6006945d2801f53","chatId":"610546ca9e884e7c86d55269e7db8ef9","sessionId":null,"userId":58723,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n老师宣布休息五分钟，写完作业的小宇望了望小杰，眼神里似乎有些着急。小杰正在看漫画，没有太注意他。小宇看了看周围的同学们，低头看了看自己的作业，又盯着小杰。这次，小杰抬头看了看小宇几秒钟，然后低头继续看他的漫画。小宇又瞟了一眼老师的位置。在休息结束的铃声响起后，小宇又向小杰使眼色。这时老师重新进入教室，告诉同学们他准备开始批改作业。此时小杰一脸惊愕，露出了惊讶的神色。\n\n[问题]\n小杰听到老师的话后会是什么感觉？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小杰感到害怕和恐惧，因为他一直在看漫画没完成作业。\nB. 小杰很高兴，因为他完成了作业才开始看漫画，所以不用担心。\nC. 小杰感到好奇，他想知道别人作业做得怎么样。\nD. 小杰感到无所谓，他并不在乎作业和老师的行为。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0031726824183452365,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e243d6006945d2801f54","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368067233,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6e2ef3eee8834c3b970036fb7593b67c"}